# Template for local development. Copy to `.dev.vars` to use it with
# `wrangler dev`. Do not commit `.dev.vars`.
#
# The Deploy to Cloudflare button also reads this file, but it treats every
# UNCOMMENTED line as a required secret and pre-fills it with the value here.
# A committed placeholder would therefore be deployed as the real secret, so
# the line stays commented. Set the real value after deploying:
#
#   npx wrangler secret put UPLOAD_SECRET
#
# Generate one with: openssl rand -hex 32
#
# UPLOAD_SECRET=
